# Phase 2 model caches and generated experiment output.
#
# Raw generation output stays local. The per-batch files hold generated
# continuations that have not been reviewed for memorised personal, copyrighted
# or unsafe content, and the per-run blobs and uncompressed score files run to
# hundreds of megabytes. What is tracked is the reported package: the aggregate
# artifacts every table and figure in the paper is built from, plus the two
# gzipped score files, so a clone can regenerate all of them.
#
# Development runs that support no claim in the paper (smoke, null-calibration,
# positive-sensitivity, the v2 bias brackets and the abandoned joint study) are
# retained locally for audit and are not part of the release.
.cache/
results/**
!results/**/

!results/phase2-reference/crosscheck.json
!results/phase2-reference/generation-parity.json

!results/phase2-nominal-fpr/nominal-fpr-cells.csv
